  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/224612cb-82f0-45e5-a1ac-2abc9cf46418-image.png\" style=\"width: 146px; height: 140px;\" /></p><p>Electric field due to each plate,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#963;</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>Q</mi></mstyle><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>A</mi><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Net electric field between the plates,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>net</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>A</mi><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Force on charged particle between the plates,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>q</mi><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>q</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/1c8260cf-9dfc-41a0-bed9-c4a4d3c6d56d-D37.png\" style=\"width: 140px; height: 167px;\" /></p><p>Now, in second case, the net electric field,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#963;</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>A</mi><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math></p><p>Force on charged particle,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>q</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>q</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>A</mi><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
